cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, its harness, or its tooling, please cite it as below."
title: "GLM-5.3-Flash on 4× CMP 170HX: Optimized Serving"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible throughput, latency, and prefill benchmarks for GLM-5.3-Flash (321B-A18B MoE)
  served with vLLM on 4× NVIDIA CMP 170HX GPUs, using pipeline parallelism and speculative
  decoding with a variable (rolling) acceptance rule. Includes the measurement harness, the
  quantization recipe, and the acceptance tooling.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "JKeys LLC"
year: 2026
url: "https://github.com/JJ48/glm53-flash-170hx-serving"
repository-code: "https://github.com/JJ48/glm53-flash-170hx-serving"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - LLM serving
  - vLLM
  - speculative decoding
  - quantization
  - benchmark
  - GLM-5.3-Flash
